:22.432Z\"\n  }\n}","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":54,"totalLines":54,"truncated":false}},"title":"journal\\2026-10-20\\run.json","time":{"start":1792528579014,"end":1792528579073}},"id":"prt_15b0779b1001qkPINdXUVA5Fnw","sessionID":"ses_ea4f89b40ffeJA5Vf8sjCWqpcq","messageID":"msg_15b0767350010wHqvIDshhxF9C"}}
