{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1792529100066,"sessionID":"ses_ea4f89b40ffeJA5Vf8sjCWqpcq","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"edit","callID":"call_00_YfYpaGryFsOQaizsRVqU8955","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"C:\\src\\m0saic-production\\one-a-day\\src\\community\\geocache-milestone-card\\v1\\geocache-milestone-card.ts","newString":"  \"problem\": [\n    \"Every Premium member can download their My Finds pocket query: a zipped GPX of every cache they logged. Project-GC's Milestones tab gives the ladder: 'the first milestones are 1, 10, 50 and 100 caches, after that and up to 1000 caches every hundredth cache is considered a milestone'.\",\n    \"CacheSleuth reads the same GPX into a profile banner ('Upload your My Finds pocket query and see your geocaching statistics'), but the shareable 'I hit N finds' card is still hand-built; a local club just posts 'geohiker55 found his 1000th find yesterday'.\"\n  ],","oldString":"  \"problem\": [\n    \"Every Premium member can download their My Finds pocket query, a zipped GPX of every cache they logged with find count, log date/type, cache type and difficulty/terrain. Project-GC's Milestones tab lists the ladder: 'the first milestones are 1, 10, 50 and 100 caches, after that and up to 1000 caches every hundredth cache is considered a milestone'. The moment repeats at every milestone and every year-in-review.\",\n    \"CacheSleuth reads the same GPX and builds a profile banner ('Upload your My Finds pocket query and see your geocaching statistics'), but the shareable 'I hit N finds' card is still hand-built. A local club just posts a plain-text note: 'geohiker55 found his 1000th find yesterday'.\"\n  ],"},"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"diff":"Index: C:\\src\\m0saic-production\\one-a-day\\src\\community\\geocache-milestone-card\\v1\\geocache-milestone-card.ts\n===================================================================\n--- C:\\src\\m0saic-production\\one-a-day\\src\\community\\geocache-milestone-card\\v1\\geocache-milestone-card.ts\n+++ C:\\src\\m0saic-production\\one-a-day\\src\\community\\geocache-milestone-card\\v1\\geocache-milestone-card.ts\n@@ -540,10 +540,10 @@\n \"id\": \"@one-a-day/community/geocache-milestone-card/v1\",\n \"title\": \"Geocache Milestone Card\",\n \"who\": \"Geocachers hitting a milestone or building a stats card, gathered on the Geocaching forums, Project-GC, and their local clubs\",\n \"problem\": [\n-  \"Every Premium member can download their My Finds pocket query, a zipped GPX of every cache they logged with find count, log date/type, cache type and difficulty/terrain. Project-GC's Milestones tab lists the ladder: 'the first milestones are 1, 10, 50 and 100 caches, after that and up to 1000 caches every hundredth cache is considered a milestone'. The moment repeats at every milestone and every year-in-review.\",\n-  \"CacheSleuth reads the same GPX and builds a profile banner ('Upload your My Finds pocket query and see your geocaching statistics'), but the shareable 'I hit N finds' card is still hand-built. A local club just posts a plain-text note: 'geohiker55 found his 1000th find yesterday'.\"\n+  \"Every Premium member can download their My Finds pocket query: a zipped GPX of every cache they logged. Project-GC's Milestones tab gives the ladder: 'the first milestones are 1, 10, 50 and 100 caches, after that and up to 1000 caches every hundredth cache is considered a milestone'.\",\n+  \"CacheSleuth reads the same GPX into a profile banner ('Upload your My Finds pocket query and see your geocaching statistics'), but the shareable 'I hit N finds' card is still hand-built; a local club just posts 'geohiker55 found his 1000th find yesterday'.\"\n ],\n \"sources\": [\n   \"https://www.cachesleuth.com/tools/profilestats\",\n   \"https://project-gc.com/w/Milestones_tab\",\n","filediff":{"file":"C:\\src\\m0saic-production\\one-a-day\\src\\community\\geocache-milestone-card\\v1\\geocache-milestone-card.ts","patch":"Index: C:\\src\\m0saic-production\\one-a-day\\src\\community\\geocache-milestone-card\\v1\\geocache-milestone-card.ts\n===================================================================\n--- C:\\src\\m0saic-production\\one-a-day\\src\\community\\geocache-milestone-card\\v1\\geocache-milestone-card.ts\n+++ C:\\src\\m0saic-production\\one-a-day\\src\\community\\geocache-milestone-card\\v1\\geocache-milestone-card.ts\n@@ -540,10 +540,10 @@\n \"id\": \"@one-a-day/community/geocache-milestone-card/v1\",\n \"title\": \"Geocache Milestone Card\",\n \"who\": \"Geocachers hitting a milestone or building a stats card, gathered on the Geocaching forums, Project-GC, and their local clubs\",\n \"problem\": [\n-  \"Every Premium member can download their My Finds pocket query, a zipped GPX of every cache they logged with find count, log date/type, cache type and difficulty/terrain. Project-GC's Milestones tab lists the ladder: 'the first milestones are 1, 10, 50 and 100 caches, after that and up to 1000 caches every hundredth cache is considered a milestone'. The moment repeats at every milestone and every year-in-review.\",\n-  \"CacheSleuth reads the same GPX and builds a profile banner ('Upload your My Finds pocket query and see your geocaching statistics'), but the shareable 'I hit N finds' card is still hand-built. A local club just posts a plain-text note: 'geohiker55 found his 1000th find yesterday'.\"\n+  \"Every Premium member can download their My Finds pocket query: a zipped GPX of every cache they logged. Project-GC's Milestones tab gives the ladder: 'the first milestones are 1, 10, 50 and 100 caches, after that and up to 1000 caches every hundredth cache is considered a milestone'.\",\n+  \"CacheSleuth reads the same GPX into a profile banner ('Upload your My Finds pocket query and see your geocaching statistics'), but the shareable 'I hit N finds' card is still hand-built; a local club just posts 'geohiker55 found his 1000th find yesterday'.\"\n ],\n \"sources\": [\n   \"https://www.cachesleuth.com/tools/profilestats\",\n   \"https://project-gc.com/w/Milestones_tab\",\n","additions":2,"deletions":2},"truncated":false},"title":"src\\community\\geocache-milestone-card\\v1\\geocache-milestone-card.ts","time":{"start":1792529100053,"end":1792529100064}},"id":"prt_15b0f66260013rzgVEn4mqIlS3","sessionID":"ses_ea4f89b40ffeJA5Vf8sjCWqpcq","messageID":"msg_15b0f4729001X2mSSXPWnw9ewK"}}
